---
layout: layouts/staff.njk
staffPage: mailing
staffNum: "05"
staffTitle: Mailing
staffHeading: Who hears from <b>you</b>
staffHint: your lists and the people on them — nobody else's
---
{#- ITS OWN PAGE, not a section of another one.

   Milestones, goals and prayer share the Ministry page because each is small
   and they are the same job. This is not that: a list has subscribers, a
   composer, a send history and an archive, and every one of those grows. It
   needs somewhere it can grow into.

   THE HEADING SAYS "nobody else's" ON PURPOSE. Isolation is the feature, and
   the person reading this screen should be able to see that it applies to
   them rather than take it on faith. -#}

{#- Only for accounts that may send as the organisation. Revealed by
   staff-mailing.js from the API's own answer, never guessed from a role read
   in the browser — a control that appears and then 403s teaches people that
   the console lies. -#}
<div class="ml-scope" id="mlScope" hidden>
  <span class="ml-scope-label" data-i18n="ml.scope">Managing</span>
  <button type="button" class="sort-btn is-on" data-scope="partner" id="mlScopeMine"></button>
  <button type="button" class="sort-btn" data-scope="organisation" data-i18n="ml.scopeOrg">Thauma</button>
</div>

<div class="ms-bar">
  <button type="button" class="solid-btn" id="mlAdd" data-i18n="ml.add">New list</button>
  <span class="hint" id="mlStatus"></span>
</div>

<p class="note ms-note" data-i18n-html="ml.privacyNote"><b>These are real people's addresses.</b>
They are visible to you and to administrators, and to nobody else — not other
partners, and not other staff. Removing somebody removes them; it is not a
flag, and it cannot be undone from here.</p>

<div class="ms-list" id="mlList">
  <p class="empty" data-i18n="common.loading">Loading…</p>
</div>

<div id="mlFormHolder"></div>

{#- The form lives here until a row is opened, then moves under that row —
   the same shared behaviour milestones, goals and prayer use. -#}
<form class="ms-form" id="mlForm" hidden>
  <input type="hidden" id="mlId">

  <div class="ms-grid">
    <label class="fld"><span data-i18n="ml.name">Name</span>
      <input type="text" id="mlName" maxlength="120" required>
      <span class="fld-hint" data-i18n="ml.nameHint">What you call it. Subscribers never see this.</span>
    </label>

    <label class="fld"><span data-i18n="ml.address">Web address</span>
      <input type="text" id="mlSlug" maxlength="60">
      <span class="fld-hint" data-i18n="ml.addressHint">Used in sign-up and unsubscribe links. Leave blank to build it from the name.</span>
    </label>
  </div>

  <label class="fld"><span data-i18n="ml.description">Description</span>
    <textarea id="mlDescription" rows="2" maxlength="400"></textarea>
  </label>

  <div class="ms-grid">
    <label class="fld"><span data-i18n="ml.fromName">From name</span>
      <input type="text" id="mlFromName" maxlength="80" required>
      <span class="fld-hint" data-i18n="ml.fromNameHint">Who the email appears to be from.</span>
    </label>

    <label class="fld"><span data-i18n="ml.fromEmail">From address</span>
      <input type="email" id="mlFromEmail" maxlength="200" required>
    </label>

    <label class="fld"><span data-i18n="ml.replyTo">Reply-to</span>
      <input type="email" id="mlReplyTo" maxlength="200">
      <span class="fld-hint" data-i18n="ml.replyToHint">Optional. Where replies go, if not the from address.</span>
    </label>
  </div>

  <div class="ms-switches">
    <button type="button" class="switch" id="mlOpen" role="switch" aria-checked="false">
      <span class="switch-track"><span class="switch-state">Off</span><span class="switch-knob"></span></span>
      <span class="switch-label"><span data-i18n="ml.open">Open for sign-ups</span>
        <span class="switch-note" data-i18n="ml.openNote">Lets a sign-up form on a website add to this list. Off means only you can add people.</span>
      </span>
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="ms-actions">
    <button type="submit" class="solid-btn" data-i18n="ml.save">Save list</button>
    <button type="button" class="ghost-btn" id="mlCancel" data-i18n="ms.cancel">Cancel</button>
    <button type="button" class="del" id="mlArchive" data-i18n="ml.archive">Archive</button>
    <span class="hint" id="mlFormStatus"></span>
  </div>
</form>

{#- Opened from a list row. Separate from the list itself because a list with
   four thousand people on it is not something to render inside a row. -#}
<section class="ml-people" id="mlPeople" hidden>
  <div class="ms-bar">
    <button type="button" class="ghost-btn" id="mlBack" data-i18n="ml.back">← All lists</button>
    <span class="ml-people-title" id="mlPeopleTitle"></span>
    <span class="hint" id="mlPeopleCount"></span>
  </div>
  <div class="ms-list" id="mlSubscribers"></div>
</section>
